  "notes": [
    "The anchor is the generalized front-runner 0x35541875 copying the attacker's pending WSZO/USDT drain (the attacker's own tx in that block failed). It later returned WSZO, wCRES, part of the ETHA and 296k of its 596k USDT to DODO's 0xdad3e839 but kept the rest, so it was no affiliated rescue (rule 5); returns are not netted.",
    "Drains of the 34 clones of DVM template 0x2bbd66: re-init exploits plus back-runs of pools left re-initialised, through 2025. Excluded: 0x05aa1630's three drains, all returned to DODO (affiliated rescue), and the attacker's recovery of its own fake tokens.",
    "wCRES is valued at the 412.48 ETH realised selling it into Uniswap (the 1,000 the front-runner returned unsold add nothing); ETHA at DefiLlama's CoinGecko series; WSZO, vETH, CMC, NPY and EGGS were never sold and carry quantity only."
